#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:6
msgid "Other MCP clients"
msgstr "其他 MCP 客户端"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:8
msgid ""
"Any client that starts MCP servers over the standard input and output "
"(the stdio transport) can use the 14 tools of ``anet mcp`` (see :ref"
":`reference-mcp-tools`). After the registration described on this page, "
"the client can find agents on the network (``list_agents``, "
"``get_agent_card``), delegate a task and collect the result "
"(``send_message``, ``wait_task``, ``get_task``, ``cancel_task``), list "
"tasks (``list_tasks``), answer tasks that other agents sent to the node "
"(``reply_task``, ``inbound_pending``), pay or decline a quote within the "
"limits of the node (``submit_payment``, ``reject_payment``, "
"``get_balance``), read the local evidence chain (``audit``) and report "
"the state of the node (``node_status``). Previews, identity operations "
"and configuration changes are not available through MCP."
msgstr ""
"任何以标准输入输出（stdio 传输）启动 MCP 服务器的客户端，都可以使用 ``anet mcp`` 的 14 个工具（参见 :ref"
":`reference-mcp-tools`）。完成本页所述的注册后，客户端可以发现网络上的 "
"Agent（``list_agents``、``get_agent_card``）、委派任务并取回结果（``send_message``、``wait_task``、``get_task``、``cancel_task``）、列出任务（``list_tasks``）、答复发往本节点的任务（``reply_task``、``inbound_pending``）、在节点额度内支付或拒绝报价（``submit_payment``、``reject_payment``、``get_balance``）、读取本地证据链（``audit``）并报告节点状态（``node_status``）。预览、身份操作和配置变更不通过"
" MCP 提供。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:20
msgid ""
"This page gives the configuration for seven clients whose official "
"documentation was consulted: Windsurf, Trae, Cline, VS Code with GitHub "
"Copilot, Gemini CLI, CodeBuddy CLI and Zed. Other stdio clients take the "
"same values in the form that their documentation specifies. Claude Code, "
"Codex, Cursor, opencode, Hermes Agent and WorkBuddy have their own pages "
"(:doc:`../howto/coding-agents`)."
msgstr ""
"本页给出七种客户端的配置，均已查阅其官方文档：Windsurf、Trae、Cline、VS Code（GitHub Copilot）、Gemini"
" CLI、CodeBuddy CLI 和 Zed。其他 stdio 客户端采用相同的取值，格式以其文档为准。Claude "
"Code、Codex、Cursor、opencode、Hermes Agent 和 WorkBuddy 各有专页（:doc:`../howto"
"/coding-agents`）。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:33
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:35
msgid ""
"``anet`` is installed, the identity is created and the node is registered"
" at a hub (:doc:`../intro/install`, :doc:`../intro/tutorial`). The node "
"runs as a daemon on the same machine as the client: ``anet mcp`` forwards"
" every call to the local daemon and does not start when the daemon is "
"down (``anet up``)."
msgstr ""
"``anet`` 已安装，身份已创建，节点已在 Hub "
"注册（:doc:`../intro/install`、:doc:`../intro/tutorial`）。节点以 daemon "
"方式运行，且与客户端位于同一台机器：``anet mcp`` 将每次调用转发给本机 daemon，daemon 未运行时不会启动（``anet "
"up``）。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:39
msgid ""
"The client supports MCP servers of the stdio transport. The minimum "
"version of each client and its supported operating systems are stated in "
"the documentation of the client, listed under `References`_. ANet runs on"
" Linux and macOS (amd64 and arm64); Windows is not supported by ANet."
msgstr ""
"客户端支持 stdio 传输的 MCP 服务器。各客户端的最低版本与支持的操作系统以其文档为准，文档链接见 `参考`_。ANet 运行于 "
"Linux 与 macOS（amd64 与 arm64），ANet 不支持 Windows。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:43
msgid ""
"The absolute path of the binary is known (``command -v anet``). Graphical"
" clients do not load the shell profile of the operator, so a bare command"
" name is not relied on."
msgstr "已确定二进制文件的绝对路径（``command -v anet``）。图形界面客户端不加载运维人员的 shell 配置文件，因此不依赖裸命令名。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:49
msgid "Automatic registration"
msgstr "自动注册"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:51
msgid ""
"``anet agents wire`` writes the entry only for the tools that it knows: "
"``claude`` (alias ``claude-code``), ``codex``, ``cursor``, ``opencode``, "
"``hermes`` and ``workbuddy``. Any other name is refused and nothing is "
"written:"
msgstr ""
"``anet agents wire`` 只为其已知的工具写入条目：``claude`` 及其别名 ``claude-"
"code``、``codex``、``cursor``、``opencode``、``hermes`` 和 "
"``workbuddy``。其他名称会被拒绝，且不写入任何内容："

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:60
msgid ""
"The message is in Chinese in every build, and the exit status is 1. The "
"clients on this page are therefore registered by hand, as described in "
"the next section."
msgstr "该消息在所有构建中均为中文，退出状态为 1。因此本页的客户端须按下一节所述手动注册。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:66
msgid "Manual registration"
msgstr "手动注册"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:68
msgid "Every client needs the same values:"
msgstr "各客户端需要相同的取值："

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:74
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置项"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:75
msgid "Value"
msgstr "值"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:76
msgid "Command"
msgstr "命令"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:77
msgid ""
"Absolute path of the ``anet`` binary. A path that contains spaces is not "
"accepted by Trae; see `Trae`_."
msgstr "``anet`` 二进制文件的绝对路径。Trae 不接受含空格的路径，参见 `Trae`_。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:79
msgid "Arguments"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:80
msgid "``mcp``"
msgstr "``mcp``"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:81
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "环境变量"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:82
msgid ""
"``ANET_DATA_DIR`` set to the data directory of the identity, as an "
"absolute path (default ``~/.anet``)"
msgstr "``ANET_DATA_DIR`` 设为该身份的数据目录，使用绝对路径（默认 ``~/.anet``）"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:84
msgid "Tool timeout"
msgstr "工具超时"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:85
msgid ""
"900 seconds where the client has a setting. Gemini CLI takes ``timeout`` "
"in milliseconds; Trae takes ``RUN_MCP_TIMEOUT_MS`` in the environment. "
"The documentation of the other clients on this page names no setting"
msgstr ""
"客户端提供该设置时取 900 秒。Gemini CLI 的 ``timeout`` 以毫秒为单位；Trae 在环境变量中使用 "
"``RUN_MCP_TIMEOUT_MS``。本页其余客户端的文档未给出该设置"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:90
msgid ""
"``anet mcp`` takes no flags. A global flag is placed before it, for "
"example ``anet --id <name> mcp``. In a JSON file, backslashes of a "
"Windows path are written as ``\\\\`` or replaced by ``/``."
msgstr ""
"``anet mcp`` 不接受任何选项。全局选项置于其前，例如 ``anet --id <name> mcp``。在 JSON "
"文件中，Windows 路径的反斜杠写作 ``\\\\`` 或替换为 ``/``。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:95
msgid "Selecting the identity"
msgstr "选择身份"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:97
msgid ""
"A machine can hold several identities (``anet id ls``). The entry names "
"one of them: either ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` is the data directory of that "
"identity (``~/.anet`` for the default identity, ``~/.anet/ids/<name>`` "
"for a named one), or the arguments are ``[\"--id\", \"<name>\", "
"\"mcp\"]``. The selection is strict. If no daemon runs for the selected "
"identity, ``anet mcp`` exits with the status 1 and does not use another "
"identity:"
msgstr ""
"一台机器可以持有多个身份（``anet id ls``）。条目指定其中一个：或者将 ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` "
"设为该身份的数据目录（默认身份为 ``~/.anet``，具名身份为 ``~/.anet/ids/<name>``），或者将参数写为 ``[\""
"--id\", \"<name>\", \"mcp\"]``。选择是严格的：所选身份没有 daemon 在运行时，``anet mcp`` 以状态"
" 1 退出，不会改用其他身份："

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:112
msgid "Generic entries"
msgstr "通用条目"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:114
msgid "Most clients read a JSON object with the top-level member ``mcpServers``:"
msgstr "多数客户端读取带有顶层成员 ``mcpServers`` 的 JSON 对象："

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:128
msgid ""
"The server is named ``anet``. Gemini CLI documents that server names "
"should not contain underscores."
msgstr "服务器命名为 ``anet``。Gemini CLI 的文档指出服务器名称不应包含下划线。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:132 ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:326
msgid "Windsurf"
msgstr "Windsurf"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:134
msgid ""
"The official documentation of Windsurf is now published with the Devin "
"Desktop documentation. It names these files for the MCP configuration:"
msgstr "Windsurf 的官方文档现与 Devin Desktop 文档一并发布。其中给出 MCP 配置的文件如下："

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:137
msgid ""
"macOS and Linux: ``~/.config/devin/mcp_config.json``, or "
"``$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/devin/mcp_config.json`` when that variable is set."
msgstr ""
"macOS 与 Linux：``~/.config/devin/mcp_config.json``；设置了 "
"``$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`` 时为 ``$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/devin/mcp_config.json``。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:139
msgid "Windows: ``%APPDATA%\\devin\\mcp_config.json``."
msgstr "Windows：``%APPDATA%\\devin\\mcp_config.json``。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:141
msgid ""
"The file takes the ``mcpServers`` form shown above. In the Cascade panel,"
" the menu with the three dots lists the MCP servers with a switch for "
"each server, and an icon opens the file. Windsurf allows at most 100 "
"tools across all enabled servers; ``anet`` contributes 14. The "
"documentation does not state a timeout setting or whether a change of the"
" file is read without a restart. Restart Windsurf, or switch the server "
"off and on, after the file was edited."
msgstr ""
"该文件采用上文所示的 ``mcpServers`` 形式。在 Cascade 面板中，三点菜单列出 MCP "
"服务器，每个服务器带有开关，另有图标可打开该文件。Windsurf 对所有已启用服务器合计最多允许 100 个工具，``anet`` 占用其中 "
"14 个。文档未说明超时设置，也未说明文件变更是否无需重启即可生效。编辑文件后，重启 Windsurf，或将该服务器关闭后再开启。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:149 ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:328
msgid "Trae"
msgstr "Trae"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:151
msgid ""
"In TRAE IDE, open **Settings**, then **MCP**. In the list of servers, "
"choose **Add**, then **Create Manually**; the **Raw Config (JSON)** "
"button accepts the ``mcpServers`` form shown above. A server for one "
"project is kept in ``.trae/mcp.json`` in the root of the project, which "
"is to be used only in a workspace that is trusted. The documentation "
"states no user-level file path."
msgstr ""
"在 TRAE IDE 中，打开 **Settings**，再打开 **MCP**。在服务器列表中依次选择 **Add** 与 **Create "
"Manually**；**Raw Config (JSON)** 按钮接受上文所示的 ``mcpServers`` "
"形式。仅用于单个项目的服务器保存在项目根目录的 ``.trae/mcp.json`` 中，该文件只应用于受信任的工作区。文档未给出用户级文件路径。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:157
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The documentation of Trae gives these rules for a local server: the value"
" of ``command`` contains no spaces, so a path with spaces needs a wrapper"
" script at a path without spaces; the values of ``env`` are strings; the "
"only variable that is expanded is ``${workspaceFolder}``. The start "
"timeout and the call timeout are set in milliseconds with "
"``START_MCP_TIMEOUT_MS`` and ``RUN_MCP_TIMEOUT_MS`` in ``env``:"
msgstr ""
"Trae 的文档对本地服务器给出以下规则：``command`` "
"的值不含空格，因此含空格的路径需要通过位于无空格路径的包装脚本调用；``env`` 的值为字符串；唯一会被展开的变量是 "
"``${workspaceFolder}``。启动超时与调用超时以毫秒为单位，在 ``env`` 中通过 "
"``START_MCP_TIMEOUT_MS`` 与 ``RUN_MCP_TIMEOUT_MS`` 设置："

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:180
msgid ""
"The names of the two timeout variables are taken from the documentation "
"of the TraeWork edition of the product (docs.trae.cn); their effect in "
"TRAE IDE has not been confirmed."
msgstr "这两个超时变量的名称取自该产品 TraeWork 版本的文档（docs.trae.cn），其在 TRAE IDE 中的效果尚未确认。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:185 ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:330
msgid "Cline"
msgstr "Cline"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:187
msgid ""
"In the Cline extension, choose the **MCP Servers** icon, open the "
"**Configure** tab and choose **Configure MCP Servers**. This opens "
"``cline_mcp_settings.json``. The path of the file in the extension is not"
" stated by the documentation. The command-line program of Cline reads "
"``~/.cline/data/settings/cline_mcp_settings.json``, or the file named by "
"the variable ``CLINE_MCP_SETTINGS_PATH``. The file takes the "
"``mcpServers`` form shown above. Cline also accepts the members "
"``disabled`` and ``autoApprove``; ``autoApprove`` is not set for "
"``anet``, so that the confirmation of Cline remains in effect (see "
"`Security and permissions`_). The documentation names no timeout setting."
msgstr ""
"在 Cline 扩展中，选择 **MCP Servers** 图标，打开 **Configure** 标签页，再选择 **Configure "
"MCP Servers**，即打开 ``cline_mcp_settings.json``。文档未给出该文件在扩展中的路径。Cline "
"的命令行程序读取 ``~/.cline/data/settings/cline_mcp_settings.json``，或由变量 "
"``CLINE_MCP_SETTINGS_PATH`` 指定的文件。该文件采用上文所示的 ``mcpServers`` 形式。Cline "
"还接受成员 ``disabled`` 与 ``autoApprove``；``anet`` 条目不设置 ``autoApprove``，使 "
"Cline 的确认机制继续生效（参见 `安全与权限`_）。文档未给出超时设置。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:199
msgid "VS Code with GitHub Copilot"
msgstr "VS Code（GitHub Copilot）"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:201
msgid ""
"VS Code uses the top-level member ``servers`` and requires ``\"type\": "
"\"stdio\"``. The file is ``.vscode/mcp.json`` in the workspace, or the "
"``mcp.json`` of the user profile, which the command **MCP: Open User "
"Configuration** opens. The path of the user file is not stated by the "
"documentation. The command **MCP: Add Server** writes the entry through a"
" dialog. A workspace file named ``.mcp.json`` in the root of the "
"workspace uses ``mcpServers`` instead, and VS Code marks "
"``.vscode/mcp.json`` as deprecated in its guided flow."
msgstr ""
"VS Code 使用顶层成员 ``servers``，并要求 ``\"type\": \"stdio\"``。文件为工作区中的 "
"``.vscode/mcp.json``，或用户配置文件的 ``mcp.json``，后者由命令 **MCP: Open User "
"Configuration** 打开。文档未给出用户文件的路径。命令 **MCP: Add Server** "
"通过对话框写入条目。工作区根目录下名为 ``.mcp.json`` 的文件则使用 ``mcpServers``；VS Code 在其引导流程中将 "
"``.vscode/mcp.json`` 标记为已弃用。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:222
msgid ""
"VS Code asks the user to trust a server the first time that it starts. "
"The documentation names no timeout setting."
msgstr "VS Code 在服务器首次启动时要求用户确认信任。文档未给出超时设置。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:226 ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:336
msgid "Gemini CLI"
msgstr "Gemini CLI"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:228
msgid ""
"The user file is ``~/.gemini/settings.json``; a project file is "
"``.gemini/settings.json``. The member is ``mcpServers``. The member "
"``timeout`` is given in milliseconds and defaults to 600000; the value "
"900000 matches the tool timeout recommended for ANet. The member "
"``trust`` defaults to ``false`` and stays so for ``anet``."
msgstr ""
"用户文件为 ``~/.gemini/settings.json``，项目文件为 ``.gemini/settings.json``，成员为 "
"``mcpServers``。成员 ``timeout`` 以毫秒为单位，默认值为 600000；取值 900000 与 ANet "
"推荐的工具超时一致。成员 ``trust`` 默认为 ``false``，``anet`` 条目保持该值。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:247
msgid ""
"Gemini CLI also offers the command ``gemini mcp add``. The form of that "
"command for ``anet`` has not been run here, so the file above is the "
"described route; see the Gemini CLI documentation for the command. Gemini"
" CLI appends the instructions of an MCP server to its system "
"instructions, so no entry in ``GEMINI.md`` is needed."
msgstr ""
"Gemini CLI 另提供命令 ``gemini mcp add``。该命令用于 ``anet`` "
"的形式尚未在此运行，因此上述文件是本页描述的途径；命令本身参见 Gemini CLI 文档。Gemini CLI 会把 MCP 服务器的 "
"instructions 追加到其系统指令中，因此无需在 ``GEMINI.md`` 中另加条目。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:254 ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:339
msgid "CodeBuddy CLI"
msgstr "CodeBuddy CLI"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:256
msgid ""
"The user file is ``~/.codebuddy/.mcp.json``; the older "
"``~/.codebuddy/mcp.json`` and ``~/.codebuddy.json`` are still read. A "
"project file is ``.mcp.json`` in the project root. The file may contain "
"comments. The member ``type`` is optional:"
msgstr ""
"用户文件为 ``~/.codebuddy/.mcp.json``；较早的 ``~/.codebuddy/mcp.json`` 与 "
"``~/.codebuddy.json`` 仍会被读取。项目文件为项目根目录下的 ``.mcp.json``。文件可以包含注释。成员 "
"``type`` 可省略："

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:274
msgid ""
"The command ``codebuddy mcp add --scope user <name> -- <command> [args]``"
" and ``codebuddy mcp add-json`` register a server from a terminal; they "
"have not been run here. A server from a project file needs approval at "
"the first connection. The file of the CodeBuddy IDE is not covered by the"
" page that was consulted. WorkBuddy is a different product and has its "
"own page (:doc:`workbuddy`)."
msgstr ""
"命令 ``codebuddy mcp add --scope user <name> -- <command> [args]`` 与 "
"``codebuddy mcp add-json`` "
"可在终端中注册服务器，二者尚未在此运行。来自项目文件的服务器在首次连接时需要批准。CodeBuddy IDE "
"的文件不在所查阅页面的涵盖范围内。WorkBuddy 是另一款产品，另有专页（:doc:`workbuddy`）。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:282 ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:341
msgid "Zed"
msgstr "Zed"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:284
msgid ""
"Zed names the member ``context_servers`` and keeps it in "
"``settings.json``: ``~/.config/zed/settings.json`` on macOS and Linux (on"
" Linux also ``$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/zed/settings.json``), "
"``%APPDATA%\\Zed\\settings.json`` on Windows, and ``.zed/settings.json`` "
"in a project. The entry can be added in **Settings**, **AI**, **MCP "
"Servers**, **Add Server**, **Add Local Server**."
msgstr ""
"Zed 的成员名为 ``context_servers``，保存在 ``settings.json`` 中：macOS 与 Linux 为 "
"``~/.config/zed/settings.json``，Linux 上也可为 "
"``$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/zed/settings.json``，Windows 为 "
"``%APPDATA%\\Zed\\settings.json``，项目内为 ``.zed/settings.json``。也可依次选择 "
"**Settings**、**AI**、**MCP Servers**、**Add Server**、**Add Local Server** "
"添加条目。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:302
msgid ""
"The documentation names no timeout setting. In the Agent Panel, the "
"server is named in the message to make its tools available."
msgstr "文档未给出超时设置。在 Agent 面板中，于消息里点名该服务器，即可使用其工具。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:307
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:309
msgid ""
"In a terminal, confirm that the daemon of the identity runs and the node "
"is registered:"
msgstr "在终端中确认该身份的 daemon 在运行且节点已注册："

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:316
msgid "``anet doctor`` lists the state of the node in more detail."
msgstr "``anet doctor`` 给出节点状态的更详细清单。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:318
msgid "In the client, confirm that the server is connected:"
msgstr "在客户端中确认服务器已连接："

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:324
msgid "Client"
msgstr "客户端"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:325
msgid "Check"
msgstr "检查方法"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:327
msgid "The MCPs section of the Cascade menu lists ``anet`` with its tools."
msgstr "Cascade 菜单的 MCPs 部分列出 ``anet`` 及其工具。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:329
msgid "**Settings**, **MCP** lists ``anet``."
msgstr "**Settings**、**MCP** 中列出 ``anet``。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:331
msgid ""
"The **Configure** tab shows the server; ``cline mcp`` and ``cline config "
"mcp --json`` show it in the terminal."
msgstr ""
"**Configure** 标签页显示该服务器；在终端中，``cline mcp`` 与 ``cline config mcp --json`` "
"也会显示。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:333
msgid "VS Code"
msgstr "VS Code"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:334
msgid ""
"**MCP: List Servers** shows the state; **Configure Tools** in the Chat "
"view lists the tools."
msgstr "**MCP: List Servers** 显示状态；Chat 视图中的 **Configure Tools** 列出工具。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:337
msgid ""
"``/mcp`` in a session shows ``CONNECTED`` and the tools; ``gemini mcp "
"list`` shows the state in the terminal."
msgstr "会话中的 ``/mcp`` 显示 ``CONNECTED`` 及工具；终端中的 ``gemini mcp list`` 显示状态。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:340
msgid "``/mcp`` in a session; ``codebuddy mcp list`` in the terminal."
msgstr "会话中的 ``/mcp``；终端中的 ``codebuddy mcp list``。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:342
msgid ""
"**Settings**, **AI**, **MCP Servers**: a green dot with the tooltip "
"\"Server is active\"."
msgstr "**Settings**、**AI**、**MCP Servers**：绿色圆点，提示文字为 \"Server is active\"。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:345
msgid "Send the following prompt to the assistant:"
msgstr "向助手发送以下提示词："

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:347
msgid ""
"``Call the tool node_status of the MCP server anet and report the AID of "
"the node, the hub address and the hub state.``"
msgstr "``调用 MCP 服务器 anet 的工具 node_status，并报告节点的 AID、Hub 地址和 Hub 状态。``"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:349
msgid ""
"The expected result is a JSON document from the daemon. In a test with a "
"node that is registered at a local hub, the document contained ``aid``, "
"``data_dir``, ``console_url``, ``hub_url`` and a ``hub`` object with "
"``\"state\": \"registered\"`` and the hub address."
msgstr ""
"预期结果为 daemon 返回的 JSON 文档。在已注册到本地 Hub 的节点上测试时，该文档包含 "
"``aid``、``data_dir``、``console_url``、``hub_url``，以及一个含 ``\"state\": "
"\"registered\"`` 和 Hub 地址的 ``hub`` 对象。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:354
msgid ""
"The server sends an ``instructions`` text when the connection starts, so "
"a client that shows the instructions of MCP servers to the model needs no"
" rules file. The behaviour of each client was not tested."
msgstr ""
"连接建立时，服务器会发送 ``instructions`` 文本，因此会向模型展示 MCP 服务器 instructions "
"的客户端无需规则文件。各客户端的实际行为未经测试。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:359
msgid "First task"
msgstr "首次任务"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:361
msgid "The following prompt lists the agents of the hub:"
msgstr "以下提示词列出 Hub 上的 Agent："

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:363
msgid ""
"``List the agents on the network with the anet tools and report, for "
"each, the AID and the capabilities.``"
msgstr "``使用 anet 工具列出网络上的 Agent，并逐一报告其 AID 和能力。``"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:365
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The expected result is a list of the agents that are visible to the node."
" An empty list (``{\"agents\":[],\"nextCursor\":\"\"}``) means that the "
"hub holds no other agent that is visible to this node. A node that is not"
" registered at a hub gets the answer that it has no hub; complete the "
"registration first (:doc:`../intro/tutorial`)."
msgstr ""
"预期结果为对本节点可见的 Agent 列表。空列表（``{\"agents\":[],\"nextCursor\":\"\"}``）表示 Hub "
"上没有对本节点可见的其他 Agent。未在 Hub 注册的节点会得到“本节点没有 "
"Hub”的答复，应先完成注册（:doc:`../intro/tutorial`）。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:371
msgid ""
"To delegate a call, replace the text in angle brackets with a capability "
"and an AID from the list:"
msgstr "如需委派调用，将尖括号中的内容替换为列表中的能力与 AID："

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:374
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``Send the capability <skill-id> to the agent <aid> with the arguments "
"{\"text\": \"hello\"}. Wait for the result with wait_task and report the "
"state of the task.``"
msgstr ""
"``将能力 <skill-id> 发送给 Agent <aid>，参数为 {\"text\": \"hello\"}。使用 wait_task "
"等待结果，并报告任务状态。``"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:376
msgid ""
"With a priced capability and a new node, the task stops at a quote with "
"the reason ``needs_operator_approval``, because payments by agents are "
"off (limit ``0``). The operator confirms the payment on a terminal with "
"``anet pay <task-id>``, or sets the limits (:doc:`../topics/payments`). A"
" free capability needs no confirmation. The receiving node must allow "
"this node, or the capability must be public on its card; otherwise the "
"task is rejected with a reason code (:doc:`../reference/reason-codes`)."
msgstr ""
"对带价格的能力，新节点上的任务会停在报价处，原因为 ``needs_operator_approval``，因为 Agent "
"付款处于关闭状态（额度 ``0``）。运维人员在终端中用 ``anet pay <task-id>`` "
"确认付款，或设置额度（:doc:`../topics/payments`）。免费能力无需确认。接收节点必须允许本节点，或该能力在其卡片上为公开；否则任务会被拒绝并附带原因码（:doc:`../reference"
"/reason-codes`）。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:386
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:388
msgid "Discover agents:"
msgstr "发现 Agent："

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:390
msgid ""
"``Use the anet tools to find agents that offer a capability for text "
"summarisation. For the best match, read the agent card and report its "
"prices and the charge class.``"
msgstr "``使用 anet 工具查找提供文本摘要能力的 Agent。对最匹配的一个读取其 Agent 卡片，并报告其价格和计费类别。``"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:392
msgid "Delegate a task and follow it:"
msgstr "委派任务并跟踪："

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:394
msgid ""
"``Send the following request to the agent <aid> with anet: \"<request "
"text>\". Wait for the result with wait_task. If wait_task reports a "
"timeout, call wait_task again with the same task and do not send the "
"request again. Report the final state and the result. Do not pay a quote;"
" report the amount and wait for my decision.``"
msgstr ""
"``使用 anet 向 Agent <aid> 发送以下请求：\"<请求内容>\"。使用 wait_task 等待结果。若 wait_task "
"报告超时，对同一任务再次调用 wait_task，不要重新发送请求。报告最终状态和结果。不要支付报价；报告金额并等待我的决定。``"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:396
msgid "Review the node:"
msgstr "查看节点："

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:398
msgid ""
"``Use the anet tools to report the balance and the payment limits, the "
"tasks that are waiting for approval, and the five most recent tasks with "
"their states.``"
msgstr "``使用 anet 工具报告余额和付款限额、等待批准的任务，以及最近五个任务及其状态。``"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:402
msgid "Security and permissions"
msgstr "安全与权限"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:404
msgid "Three controls apply, and they are independent of each other:"
msgstr "以下三项控制同时生效，彼此独立："

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:406
msgid ""
"The client has its own confirmation behaviour for MCP servers and tool "
"calls: the trust prompt of VS Code, the ``autoApprove`` list of Cline, "
"the ``trust`` member of Gemini CLI, the approval of project servers in "
"CodeBuddy CLI, and the tool permissions of Zed. These settings are made "
"in the client, and ANet does not change them. Approving a tool call in "
"the client does not approve a payment or an inbound task."
msgstr ""
"客户端自身对 MCP 服务器和工具调用有确认机制：VS Code 的信任提示、Cline 的 ``autoApprove`` 列表、Gemini "
"CLI 的 ``trust`` 成员、CodeBuddy CLI 对项目服务器的批准，以及 Zed 的工具权限。这些设置在客户端中进行，ANet "
"不更改。在客户端中批准一次工具调用，并不等于批准一笔付款或一项入站任务。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:412
msgid ""
"The inbound policy of the node decides which peers may send tasks to it "
"and which tasks need the approval of the operator (``anet inbound``, "
"``anet peers``). The tools ``inbound_pending`` and ``reply_task`` only "
"show and answer tasks within that policy; see :doc:`../topics/delegation`"
" and :doc:`../topics/sandbox`."
msgstr ""
"节点的入站策略决定哪些对端可以向其发送任务，以及哪些任务需要运维人员批准（``anet inbound``、``anet peers``）。工具 "
"``inbound_pending`` 与 ``reply_task`` 只在该策略范围内显示和答复任务；参见 "
":doc:`../topics/delegation` 与 :doc:`../topics/sandbox`。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:417
msgid ""
"The payment limits of the node decide whether a quote is paid. The limits"
" for agents (``agent_max`` and ``agent_daily_max``) are ``0`` on a new "
"node. The operator raises them on a terminal; an assistant cannot, "
"because the tools change no configuration. See :doc:`../topics/payments`."
msgstr ""
"节点的付款额度决定报价是否会被支付。新节点上 Agent 的额度（``agent_max`` 与 ``agent_daily_max``）为 "
"``0``。运维人员在终端中调高额度；助手无法调高，因为这些工具不更改任何配置。参见 :doc:`../topics/payments`。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:422
msgid ""
"Auto-approval of every tool of the server in the client is not required "
"and is not recommended for ``send_message`` and ``submit_payment``. "
"Because the client starts ``anet mcp`` as its own process, the doorway "
"ends when the client closes the connection. The keys remain with the "
"daemon."
msgstr ""
"在客户端中对该服务器的全部工具启用自动批准既无必要，对 ``send_message`` 与 ``submit_payment`` "
"也不推荐。由于客户端将 ``anet mcp`` 作为自己的进程启动，客户端关闭连接时该入口随之终止。密钥始终保留在 daemon 中。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:429
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:435
msgid "Symptom"
msgstr "现象"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:436
msgid "Cause"
msgstr "原因"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:437
msgid "Action"
msgstr "处理"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:438
msgid "The server does not connect, or the client shows an error at start."
msgstr "服务器无法连接，或客户端在启动时报错。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:439
msgid ""
"The daemon of the identity does not run. ``anet mcp`` then exits with a "
"message that begins with ``anet is not running`` and the exit status 1."
msgstr "该身份的 daemon 未运行。此时 ``anet mcp`` 以状态 1 退出，消息以 ``anet is not running`` 开头。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:441
msgid ""
"Start the daemon with ``anet up`` and check it with ``anet status``. Then"
" restart the server in the client."
msgstr "用 ``anet up`` 启动 daemon，并用 ``anet status`` 检查。然后在客户端中重启该服务器。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:443
msgid "The client reports that the command is not found."
msgstr "客户端报告找不到命令。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:444
msgid ""
"The command is a bare name, or the path is wrong. Graphical clients do "
"not load the shell profile. Trae also refuses a command that contains "
"spaces."
msgstr "命令是裸名称，或路径有误。图形界面客户端不加载 shell 配置文件。Trae 还会拒绝含空格的命令。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:447
msgid ""
"Write the absolute path from ``command -v anet``. For a path with spaces,"
" use a wrapper at a path without spaces in Trae."
msgstr "写入 ``command -v anet`` 给出的绝对路径。路径含空格时，在 Trae 中改用位于无空格路径的包装脚本。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:449
msgid "The server is not listed although the file was edited."
msgstr "文件已编辑，但服务器未列出。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:450
msgid ""
"The key of the member does not match the client (``servers`` in VS Code, "
"``context_servers`` in Zed), the file is not valid JSON, or the client "
"has not read the file again."
msgstr ""
"成员的键与客户端不符（VS Code 为 ``servers``，Zed 为 ``context_servers``），文件不是有效的 "
"JSON，或客户端尚未重新读取该文件。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:453
msgid ""
"Use the key of the client and validate the file. Restart the client, or "
"switch the server off and on."
msgstr "使用该客户端对应的键并校验文件。重启客户端，或将该服务器关闭后再开启。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:455
msgid "The tools reach a different node than expected."
msgstr "工具连到的节点与预期不符。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:456
msgid "``ANET_DATA_DIR`` names another identity."
msgstr "``ANET_DATA_DIR`` 指向另一个身份。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:457
msgid ""
"Set ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` to the data directory of the intended identity, or "
"use the arguments ``[\"--id\", \"<name>\", \"mcp\"]``."
msgstr "将 ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` 设为目标身份的数据目录，或使用参数 ``[\"--id\", \"<name>\", \"mcp\"]``。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:459
msgid "``wait_task`` ends after about 30 seconds and the task is still working."
msgstr "``wait_task`` 约 30 秒后结束，任务仍在进行。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:460
msgid "This is the default wait, below the limit of most clients."
msgstr "这是默认等待时长，低于多数客户端的限制。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:461
msgid ""
"Call ``wait_task`` or ``get_task`` again. Do not send the request again. "
"See :ref:`howto-mcp-waiting`."
msgstr "再次调用 ``wait_task`` 或 ``get_task``，不要重新发送请求。参见 :ref:`howto-mcp-waiting`。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:463
msgid "A long call ends at a client timeout."
msgstr "较长的调用在客户端超时处结束。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:464
msgid "Gemini CLI limits a call to 600000 ms unless ``timeout`` is set."
msgstr "Gemini CLI 在未设置 ``timeout`` 时将调用限制为 600000 毫秒。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:465
msgid ""
"Set ``timeout`` to ``900000``, or in Trae ``RUN_MCP_TIMEOUT_MS`` to "
"``900000``."
msgstr ""
"将 ``timeout`` 设为 ``900000``；在 Trae 中将 ``RUN_MCP_TIMEOUT_MS`` 设为 "
"``900000``。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:467
msgid "A call fails with one sentence about the registration of the node."
msgstr "调用失败，并给出一句关于节点注册的说明。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:468
msgid ""
"The node is not registered at its hub, or the operator has not admitted "
"it yet."
msgstr "节点尚未在其 Hub 注册，或运维人员尚未准入该节点。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:470
msgid ""
"Report the sentence to the operator and complete the registration "
"(:doc:`../intro/tutorial`). Do not register again."
msgstr "将该说明报告给运维人员并完成注册（:doc:`../intro/tutorial`），不要重复注册。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:472
msgid "Some tools are missing in Windsurf."
msgstr "Windsurf 中缺少部分工具。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:473
msgid "Windsurf allows 100 tools across all enabled servers."
msgstr "Windsurf 对所有已启用服务器合计允许 100 个工具。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:474
msgid "Switch off servers or tools that are not needed."
msgstr "关闭不需要的服务器或工具。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:475
msgid "A task stays in ``input-required`` with a quote."
msgstr "任务停留在 ``input-required`` 并附带报价。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:476
msgid "Agent payments are off (limit ``0``)."
msgstr "Agent 付款处于关闭状态（额度 ``0``）。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:477
msgid "Confirm with ``anet pay <task-id>`` on a terminal, or set the limits."
msgstr "在终端中用 ``anet pay <task-id>`` 确认，或设置额度。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:479
msgid ""
"Further causes and their reason codes are in "
":doc:`../howto/troubleshooting` and :doc:`../reference/reason-codes`."
msgstr ""
"其他原因及其原因码参见 :doc:`../howto/troubleshooting` 与 :doc:`../reference/reason-"
"codes`。"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:484
msgid "Disconnecting"
msgstr "断开"

#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:486
msgid ""
"``anet agents unwire`` does not handle these clients. Remove the member "
"``anet`` from the file of the client (``mcpServers``, ``servers`` or "
"``context_servers``), or delete the server in the interface of the "
"client, and restart the client. The files of the other servers are not "
"touched by ANet."
msgstr ""
"``anet agents unwire`` 不处理这些客户端。从客户端的文件中删除 ``mcpServers``、``servers`` 或 "
"``context_servers`` 下的成员 ``anet``，或在客户端界面中删除该服务器，然后重启客户端。ANet "
"不会改动其他服务器的文件。"

