#: ../../agents/other-mcp.rst:514
msgid ""
"The client facts on this page were read from the pages above on "
"2026-10-17; no client was run. The following points are not confirmed and"
" follow the documentation of the installed version: the user-level file "
"paths of Trae, of the Cline extension, of VS Code and of the CodeBuddy "
"IDE; timeout settings other than those named above; whether a change of "
"the file is read without a restart; whether the instructions of the MCP "
"server reach the model in each client; and the behaviour of each client "
"against a hub. The connection of ``anet mcp`` itself (initialization, the"
" list of 14 tools, ``node_status``, ``list_agents`` and ``get_balance``) "
"was tested against a local hub."
msgstr ""
"本页的客户端信息于 2026-10-17 读取自上述页面，未运行任何客户端。以下几点尚未确认，以所安装版本的文档为准：Trae、Cline "
"扩展、VS Code 和 CodeBuddy IDE 的用户级文件路径；上文已列出之外的超时设置；文件变更是否无需重启即可读取；各客户端是否会将 "
"MCP 服务器的 instructions 传给模型；以及各客户端对接 Hub 时的行为。``anet mcp`` 本身的连接（初始化、14 "
"个工具的列表、``node_status``、``list_agents`` 与 ``get_balance``）已针对本地 Hub 测试。"

